---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="ExCSV Tools & Libraries" description="CLI tools and libraries that implement the ExCSV v0.3 specification.">
  <h1>Tools &amp; Libraries</h1>
  <p class="intro">
    Implementations built on the <a href="/spec/">ExCSV v0.3 specification</a>.
    This list is curated — if you ship a library or CLI, open an issue on the
    <a href="https://github.com/boligolov/excsv" target="_blank" rel="noopener">spec repo</a>.
  </p>

  <section class="tool-list">
    <article class="tool-card">
      <div class="tool-head">
        <div>
          <h2><a href="https://github.com/boligolov/excsv-golang" target="_blank" rel="noopener">excsv-golang</a></h2>
          <p class="tool-meta">Go · CLI + library · Reference implementation</p>
        </div>
        <span class="badge">v0.3</span>
      </div>

      <p>
        Reference command-line tool and Go library for ExCSV. Supports plain
        (<code>.excsv</code>, <code>.extsv</code>) and row-ZIP
        (<code>.excsv.zip</code>, <code>.extsv.zip</code>) storage forms.
        <a href="/variants/pack/">Pack</a> (<code>.excsv.pack.zip</code>) is specified in v0.3 but not implemented here yet.
      </p>

      <ul class="feature-list">
        <li>Parse, validate, and serialize ExCSV documents</li>
        <li>Header, metadata, rows, and conversion commands</li>
        <li>ZIP wrap / unwrap / peek with <code>original-size</code> checks</li>
        <li>Fixture-driven tests against the shared <code>fixtures/</code> corpus</li>
      </ul>

      <div class="tool-install">
        <h3>Install</h3>
        <pre><code>go install github.com/boligolov/excsv-golang/cmd/excsv@latest</code></pre>
      </div>

      <div class="tool-example">
        <h3>Quick start</h3>
        <pre><code>excsv validate data.excsv
excsv info data.excsv --json
excsv zip peek archive.excsv.zip
excsv convert to-csv data.excsv</code></pre>
      </div>

      <p class="tool-links">
        <a href="https://github.com/boligolov/excsv-golang" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>
        ·
        <a href="https://github.com/boligolov/excsv-golang#usage" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Usage docs</a>
        ·
        <a href="https://pkg.go.dev/github.com/boligolov/excsv-golang/pkg/excsv" target="_blank" rel="noopener">pkg/excsv</a>
      </p>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section class="coming-soon">
    <h2>Planned</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Pack CLI</strong> — <code>col get</code>, <code>table list</code>, <code>pack create</code> on <code>.excsv.pack.zip</code> (<a href="/variants/pack/">spec §10.5</a>).</li>
      <li>Python package (<code>excsv</code>) and additional language bindings — see the
        <a href="https://github.com/boligolov/excsv/blob/master/plan/README.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener">implementation plan</a>.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .intro {
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    max-width: 42rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  .tool-list {
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }
  .tool-card {
    background: var(--color-card-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 1.75rem;
    max-width: 48rem;
  }
  .tool-head {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .tool-head h2 {
    margin: 0 0 0.25rem;
    font-size: 1.35rem;
  }
  .tool-head h2 a {
    color: var(--color-text);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .tool-head h2 a:hover {
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }
  .tool-meta {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }
  .badge {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    background: var(--color-accent);
    color: #fff;
    padding: 0.25em 0.6em;
    border-radius: 6px;
    height: fit-content;
  }
  .tool-card > p {
    color: var(--color-muted);
    line-height: 1.65;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }
  .feature-list {
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  .tool-install h3,
  .tool-example h3 {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
  }
  .tool-install,
  .tool-example {
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }
  pre {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0.85rem 1rem;
    background: var(--color-code-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    overflow-x: auto;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }
  .tool-links {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
  .coming-soon {
    margin-top: 3rem;
    padding-top: 2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    max-width: 42rem;
  }
  .coming-soon h2 {
    border: none;
    padding: 0;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }
  .coming-soon p {
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }
</style>
